WEBVTT

00:07:59.403 --> 00:08:01.848
Cfare kam veshur?

00:08:01.848 --> 00:08:04.739
(Te qeshura)

00:08:04.739 --> 00:08:10.550
(Duartrokitje)

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:12.899
Vemendja eshte dicka e fuqishme.

00:08:12.899 --> 00:08:15.698
Sic ju thashe, i jep forme realitetit tuaj.

00:08:15.698 --> 00:08:18.319
Pra, ma merr mendja me duhet t'ju parashtroj ate pyetjen juve.

00:08:18.319 --> 00:08:20.190
Nese do kishit mundesi te kontrollonit vemendjen e dikujt,

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:22.409
cfare do benit me te?

00:08:22.409 --> 00:08:23.711
Falemnderit.

00:08:23.711 --> 00:08:30.188
(Duartrokitje)